# Read on 20a9fc5d's src/ (git archive to the scratchpad), virtualClock only, no wall-clock reading.
# A wrong build of budget W is stood in by `go movetime W` (or a bare `go` for 3000) on the same step.
# The A6-d1 "5000" stand-in is NOT a reachable wrong build: the session caps every budget at level 3's
# 3 000 ms, so it reads the same as the correct build. A6-d1's targeted wrong build (M12, ponder not held)
# is caught by its line counts, not by time. A7-f2 names no wrong value; "1" is an illustrative low G.
